From d0f1fea45a2259f22fc1655729cc83979e341785 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:00:44 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: native Settings About section with live GitHub
 update check

Adds a CaeliGlow-branded About page to the Settings window showing the
CaeliGlow version, the Noctalia base version and MIT attribution, plus a
live "Check for updates" button. The button uses Noctalia existing async
HttpClient to query the mockifylab/CaeliGlow GitHub releases endpoint and
reports the result through the tested semver comparison model. Gated by
shell.offlineMode; release notes are displayed as text and never executed.
